    <section id="testusernamespacenotification-example-command">
      <title>Example command</title>
      <codeblock outputclass="language-terminal">$ curl -X POST \
-H "Authorization: Bearer &lt;bearer_token&gt;" \
https://&lt;quay-server.example.com&gt;/api/v1/user/namespacenotifications/&lt;uuid&gt;/test</codeblock>
    </section>
    <section id="testusernamespacenotification-example-output">
      <title>Example output</title>
      <codeblock outputclass="language-json">{}</codeblock>
      <note type="note">
        <p>For <b>email</b> notifications, the test notification is routed to the user account email address. For other methods such as Slack or webhook, routing follows the notification <codeph>config</codeph>.</p>
      </note>
    </section>
  </refbody>
</reference>
